# Camera Path (Cinema Studio) — LLM that converts a drawn path into
# cinematic camera directions. Any OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions
# gateway works. Without a key the feature falls back to a deterministic
# rule-based direction builder (still functional, less nuanced).
SUPERBAPI_KEY=
SUPERBAPI_BASE_URL=https://www.superbapi.com/v1
SUPERBAPI_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
